cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the SplitAligner preprint below. This 0.1.0 package is a V1 release candidate; a software DOI will be added only after final release approval."
title: "SplitAligner: Branch-Identity Coordinate System for Phylogenomics under Missing Taxa and Gene-Tree Discordance"
abstract: "SplitAlignerR V1 release-candidate implementation of the SplitAligner branch-coordinate framework, with a C++17 production mapper, a separate pure R Catnip10 graph Oracle, strict finite-range numeric validation, and audit-ready paired-output provenance."
type: software
